{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls, the hunt begins in <strong>Enchanted Vampire Defense</strong>...<br>An ancient curse has unleashed legions of bloodthirsty vampires upon the land. The enchanted realm is under threat, and only you stand between it and eternal night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gothic-themed <strong>tower defense</strong> game, you\u2019ll place magical towers and defenses to hold off waves of cunning, powerful vampire enemies. Each wave brings new threats\u2014but you wield the power of enchantments, light, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd87 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical tower types with unique effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven progression through cursed lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich visuals, atmospheric music, and intense gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanted Vampire Defense</strong> isn\u2019t just about building towers\u2014it\u2019s about resisting the darkness, one wave at a time.<br>Prepare your defenses, summon your power, and fight back against the vampire onslaught!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690250?t=1749585507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690250?t=1749585507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690250/6c469967d18aed724ae66545e3c5e3e7867afb4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749585507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690250/6c469967d18aed724ae66545e3c5e3e7867afb4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749585507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness 